+# Wire Format
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on a wire serialisation format. No policy, ADR, or governance document in this repository designates a required or default wire serialisation format; the codebase supports multiple formats (including JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, and MsgPack) as implemented features, but nothing here records a project decision selecting one of them as the standard.
